{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりです、なかむられのです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ8FXVAV3DAY6PX0ZHK0ZPH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅らせながら、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10th YEAR BIRTHDAY LIVE"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず率直な感想！から！ね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの野外ライブ最高だった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイリウムの景色がとっても綺麗だった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生オケ素敵すぎて耳が幸せだった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場とっても広かった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ走った！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく走った！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マラソン選手してるかと思った！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってまあ書いてたらキリないので\n一旦この辺にして。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10周年という節目を皆様と直接"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お祝いできて嬉しかったですし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日産スタジアムという大きな会場に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイリウムでいっぱいの景色が本当に綺麗で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鳥肌立ちました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業生の皆様も来てくださり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感極まる瞬間も沢山。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて10年という乃木坂の歴史の重みを感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変化し続けるグループだと思いますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"根本的にあるものはきっと変わらなくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちの憧れた姿と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ここにあるグループの形を大切に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで頑張れたらいいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この場所がずっと大好きな場所でありますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくお願いします！！✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7月には真夏の全国ツアーが\n大阪からスタートします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"健康第一で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この夏を一緒にたのしみましょうね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インスタには載せたんだけど\nライブ初日にやってた歩夢ちゃんヘア。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ8FZ0K89RH05QHWGVAY0AK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中村麗乃"}],"source":"archive"}